ootenai-county"],["ARC or PLC in Kootenai County","/arc-plc/idaho/kootenai-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record from 1951 to 2025 shows July to August came in under 90% of normal in 39 of 75 years on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 12 grids, more than any other pair. In 2025, June to July ran 14% of normal and July to August 26% on the middle of the grids. Grid 32755 had its driest year in 1952 at 59% of normal. On grid 33054, the preliminary estimate for July to August 2026 is 3.6.</p>"}
